                                                "sense_id": "cdcbf8f7-9d0d-31a9-b9bd-c74e74105c27",
                                                "text": "The highly significant findings with regard to hurt feelings suggests that the hypothesis that rheumatoids learn to hide their hurt feelings [7] and are reticent about expressing their dissatisfactions [4] may be correct."
